      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present No.18 Ormond Square Smithfield to the market.\r\nOrmond Square is a historic residential square in the heart of Smithfield, developed in the early 20th century on the site of the former Ormond Market, a vibrant trading hub that served Dublin from the 1690s. Its distinctive red-brick homes and strong sense of community have made it one of Dublin 7’s most established neighbourhoods. Today, the area’s rich heritage is being complemented by exciting regeneration plans, including the ongoing redevelopment of the historic Ormond Market site, which is set to bring new retail, cultural and community amenities to the locality. \r\nThis lovely property has been fully refurbished throughout and is in excellent turn key condition. No: 18 has been internally insulated and also a candidate for the vacant home scheme as it has been vacant for over two years.\r\nOn the ground floor you are welcomed into a generous bright and light open plan living and dining area with a feature fireplace, this leads through to a generous modern kitchen with belfast sink.  To the rear of the kitchen is a small hallway leading to a beautiful newly renovated shower room and providing access to the small private and sunny courtyard at the rear of the property.\r\nOn the first floor you will find two generously sized bright and airy bedrooms.\r\nTo the front of the property is a delightful communal area with the James Gandon designed four courts as the backdrop. \r\nNumber 18 Ormond Square is a short walk from Dublin City Centre, hospitals and the Luas among many other key transport links and this property offers easy access to a host of amenities Dublin city living has to offer with a  vast selection of local shops, bars and cafes.\r\nGiven No.18’s proximity to the city centre and turn key condition this wonderful property will be extremely attractive to first time buyers, city workers and investors and early viewing is highly recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nNewly refurbished 2 bedroom property\r\nInsulated\r\nCandidate for the vacant home grant \r\nCity Centre Location\r\nRed Brick Historical Property\r\nTurn Key Condition"
      },
